<title>UK: KFW unit sets 250 billion lire 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>KFW unit sets 250 billion lire 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nazionale del Lavoro, Banca Commerciale Italiana SpA and Bear Stearns.</p>
<p>BORROWER  KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR KREDITANSTALT FUER WEIDERAUFBAU  (AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    250 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.25 PCT  MATURITY    16.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    16.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00 PCT  REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+=</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMS US/UK/IT/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>		SENIOR AND UNSECURED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
